# Not part of the site. Everything listed here is excluded from the deployment
# upload, so it has no URL on speculaone.com.
#
# Verified against the live site rather than assumed: CLAUDE.md and scripts/
# have been listed here since before this change and both return 404, while
# index.html and report.js serve normally.

CLAUDE.md
scripts/

# Local development and verification only.
#
# dev/report-harness.html renders complete audit reports from hand-built
# payloads, including a passing Full Audit showing the Specula Mark for a
# property that does not exist. That must never be reachable on the company
# domain, where it would read as a genuine certification. A noindex meta tag
# stops search engines and nobody else, so the file is excluded here and lives
# outside the site tree.
dev/

# Node test tooling. package.json exists only so `node --test` can run and so
# Node reads the root .js modules as ESM. Nothing here is bundled or served,
# and excluding it keeps the deployment identical to the static passthrough
# that is live today.
package.json
package-lock.json
node_modules/
